  "description": "The linear value of an empty sRGB8 base (phase1.25_pilot-wand item 2.6, decision 126): an empty project on the authored plane created with the shipped template templates/PBR - Specular Glossiness.spt; BaseColor and Specular (Painter skips a map the template lacks) at OpenEXR 32f, and at PNG 16 as the control against the recorded base-values code; infinite padding, no dithering, every export step done twice in the session.",
  "inputs": [
    {
      "input_id": "plane",
      "kind": "mesh",
